  "definition": "Sound Level Limits for Stationary Snowmobiles",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-04-30",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18; amd by #13199, eff 4-30-21",
